h-Hant"],[["今天路過順道進來晃晃\n可惜的是二郎系都賣完了，選擇了泡系鴨白湯拉麵（日本鹹）\n細膩香醇的鴨湯鹹的恰到好處，即使吃的慢了一點依然不會感覺到失去風味。\n洋蔥球的轉味不太明顯，但也毫無違和，一片甜橙讓湯頭增加了清新的口感，幾片食用花也讓整體增色不少。\n鴨肉叉燒和舒肥雞太嫩了，嫩到不合我的口感，這部分就見仁見智了。\n中太麵口感不錯。\n只是老闆ㄧ個人工作，速度真的會很慢。\n下次再來補充二郎系的心得吧",null,[0,73]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16917976989888429665/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDVVV4WE5WUlRhMWt5V1RCa2RVNHdjR3BpVlRsYVpWZFpkMWxzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1843,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCUUxXNVRTa1kyWTBkdU4wcGpiVTlaZVdZd1lsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37d4f87c6bdce5eb!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjBQLW5TSkY2Y0duN0pjbU9ZeWYwYlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCUUxXNVRTa1kyWTBkdU4wcGpiVTlaZVdZd1lsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCUUxXNVRTa1kyWTBkdU4wcGpiVTlaZVdZd1lsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCUUxXNVRTa1kyWTBkdU4wcGpiVTlaZVdZd1lsRRILMGUySkl0SXdvZVEaPgovQ0FJUUFD